{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Skogsgl\u00e4ntan, Saga\u2019s brand new Bed and Breakfast for creatures from Nordic folklore!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage a woodland sanctuary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/DecorRoom2-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750687557\" /></div>Cook, build, decorate and farm to make your Bed and Breakfast flourish into the cozy retreat of your (and Saga\u2019s) dreams!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend strange and wonderful creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/GreetingGuest.gif?t=1750687557\" /></div>From Bysen to The Mountain King himself, meet a colorful cast of characters in all shapes and sizes! Learn their quirks and see how their stories unfold...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore a fantastical landscape</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/SagaRunning24FPS-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750687557\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture out far beyond your new home and gather resources, meet new characters, and uncover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No rush - no worries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Saga\u2019s world, you can take things at your own pace! Dash through quests, pamper all your guests and collect every resource, or lean back and do things when you feel like it - play without pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819560?t=1750687557","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.